Package: shift-layout
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, systemd, udev, xkb-data
Description: shifted US and Dvorak keyboard layouts
 Installs custom XKB layouts with unshifted punctuation on the digit row and
 hardware-database remaps for the original Carbon X1 and a Dell Precision 5490.
